{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_017_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_017_title", "source_sha256": "194406d397232b3440e4377d29d5692637480b88fad991d91e9d99f76244f5b2", "ja": "彼女が選ぶ成長のカタチ", "zh": "她选择的成长形式", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_017_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_017_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ed4f122d85fddf04d272ae22cfed87cbed0d9d4cec5e501bf001f1876b97f22c", "ja": "次の定期公演を一任され、どうしたらいいか\n悩むこのみ。成長するためにはなんでも1人\nでできなくてはいけないと思い詰めていたが\nあずさのアドバイスで、まずは自分のできる\n範囲で全力を尽くすべきだと気がついた。", "zh": "木实被指定负责下次的定期公演，\n她却不知该如何是好。木实一直认为\n如果要让自我成长，凡事都必须独力完成，\n但在听了梓的建议之后，她才领悟到\n自己应该先尽力而为。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_017_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_017_1000_p", "source_sha256": "10d1be42156148a91e19f0c2e844660f2c99668530e15f6661b55ae9bb143a32", "ja": "このみさん、ブログ読みましたよ。", "zh": "木实，我看过部落格了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_017_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_017_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ae33f36f1764cec54eb39d89016b47dabbaf3a466d67fca310e20eb00feaedca", "ja": "次にセンターになる子も勇気がもらえるような、\nいい内容でしたね！", "zh": "感觉下个当Center的人看完也能得到勇气，\n你写得真棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_017_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_017_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "d50a6fd7192f17e720935a97badc4fec92872af478e19e16738d4bfaf20be7ff", "ja": "ふふ、そうかしら？　ありがとう♪　……それに\nしても、ライブ、とっても楽しかったわよね～！！", "zh": "呵呵，是吗？谢谢夸奖♪\n……话说回来，演唱会真的很开心呢～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_017_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_017_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "cb961e905ba0b8b5447f547eb119a39ef3b646d47453f7214b381265926bff6f", "ja": "本番前はあんなに緊張したのに、終わってみたら、\nまたすぐにでもステージに立ちたいって思ってるの。", "zh": "登台前明明那么紧张，结果表演一结束，\n我又想立刻冲回舞台了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_017_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_017_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "bd4b398aaeb596e3596995fea2012cf4307f40bf8f7b235b27dde8adad2c342a", "ja": "次はもっとこうしたい、とか、こういう経験を\nしてみたい、とか、やりたいこともたくさんあるし。", "zh": "我下次想做得更好，还想试试其他体验，\n心里有好多想做的事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_017_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_017_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4dee06e20de6ff265fa211d31cc5b6d4137c5e0ed4755babbe093d45fb0e6c99", "ja": "このみさん、やる気に満ちあふれていますね！", "zh": "木实，你现在充满了干劲呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_017_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_017_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "71001f3b9060400fb83d48c432a31c6312612765d1a8aa955755b730e1e348c7", "ja": "ウフフ、やる気と大人のセクシーなら、\nいつも満ちあふれているわよ！", "zh": "呵呵，论干劲跟成熟的性感魅力，\n我没有一刻不是满的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_017_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_017_1007_p", "source_sha256": "23ba887f9cfb38fc5f9d8cea6320c4ce053e8014658bf53222802378579a84e1", "ja": "そういうことなら……わかりました。\n次のステージ、検討しておきますね。", "zh": "这样的话……我知道了。\n下次表演我会纳入考量的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_017_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_017_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "b0af9c59374b9059d487386b31bc1e1cad4d4fab9aad59d50a2cb5ec68db8a04", "ja": "お願いします、{$P$}♪\nそれじゃあ、そろそろレッスンだから行くわね。", "zh": "麻烦你了，{$P$}♪\n那差不多要到练习的时间了，我先走啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_017_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_017_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "ab6740600cb30fdb5ba8a6a9f6eaba1bbc4c879c09e69f83fe6ad5a73c5276ac", "ja": "今日はダンスで、目いっぱい汗をかくって\n決めてるのよ。", "zh": "我要在今天的舞蹈练习上\n尽情地挥洒汗水。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_017_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_017_1010_p", "source_sha256": "46b95c4c397950a7784997cac108ea6ff775228c8c351681360a48ccde049877", "ja": "ずいぶん気合いが入ってますね。", "zh": "这么拚啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_017_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_017_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "e4d53b346ccd4c0e8f9997bb9ecb1ffa5805cdf663addd51bb3036a56c9ac9b4", "ja": "実はね……莉緒ちゃんから美味しいおつまみが、\nまた手に入ったって、連絡があったの～！", "zh": "其实……莉绪有联络我，\n说她又弄到了好吃的下酒菜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_017_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_017_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "25db82e6d7ee60267c6946b16c5ac5ac58218fa2dbfaa1182823ff6085512509", "ja": "レッスンの後の1杯のために、\n喉がカラカラになるまで頑張っちゃうわよ！", "zh": "为了练习后的那一杯，\n我要练到喉咙干涸为止！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_017_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_017_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "77b4ceee3d4abcb46548bb6219981865548a88e781ad72d822016ced5f2c3426", "ja": "{$P$}もよかったら一緒にどう？\n莉緒ちゃんの家に集合よ。じゃ、考えといてね！", "zh": "如果{$P$}有空要不要也一起来？\n在莉绪家集合喔。先这样，你考虑一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
